# Code-owner review for release machinery, the manifest, every VERSION, the setup
# entrypoint, hooks and the skill pack. The author is the only code owner. The
# code-owner-review ruleset exempts the marketplace bot whatever its PR changes, so
# an auto-merge the bot requests (it merges as the bot) skips the author's review:
# its manifest-only repin PRs always request one, its install-release pin PRs only
# while the repository variable HOV_PINS_AUTO_MERGE is true, and otherwise wait for
# the author to merge them. The require-ci ruleset has no bypass, so every bot PR
# still needs every required check.
/.github/            @StartupBros
/release/            @StartupBros
/.claude-plugin/     @StartupBros
**/VERSION           @StartupBros
/setup               @StartupBros
/hooks/              @StartupBros
/plugins/hov-stack/   @StartupBros
